Package: asmi-taskbar-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: A modern, minimalist taskbar for Xfce
 Asmi Taskbar is a modern, minimalist taskbar plugin for the Xfce panel.
 It groups application windows together as an icon and allows pinning them
 as launchers when the application is not running.
